  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Opening Requirement**: The first meld(s) played to the table must total **40 or 51 points** (depending on house rules). Once 'open', you can meld any value.\n2. **Melds**: Sets (Groups) of 3-4 cards of same rank, or Runs (Sequences) of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit.\n3. **Joker Rules**: Wild cards can replace any card. Can be 'stolen' by replacing with the natural card.\n4. **Scoring**: Numbered cards (2-10) = Face value. Face cards (J, Q, K) = 10. Ace = 11. Joker = 15 points (or 25 as penalty).",
    Player: "1. **Opening Requirement**: The first meld(s) played to the table must total **40 or 51 points** (depending on house rules). Once 'open', you can meld any value.\n2. **Melds**: Sets (Groups) of 3-4 cards of same rank, or Runs (Sequences) of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit.\n3. **Joker Rules**: Wild cards can replace any card. Can be 'stolen' by replacing with the natural card.\n4. **Scoring**: Numbered cards (2-10) = Face value. Face cards (J, Q, K) = 10. Ace = 11. Joker = 15 points (or 25 as penalty).",
    objective: "Be the first to meld all cards in hand ('Going Kalooki').",
    gameplay: "1. **Opening Requirement**: The first meld(s) played to the table must total **40 or 51 points** (depending on house rules). Once 'open', you can meld any value.\n2. **Melds**: Sets (Groups) of 3-4 cards of same rank, or Runs (Sequences) of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit.\n3. **Joker Rules**: Wild cards can replace any card. Can be 'stolen' by replacing with the natural card.\n4. **Scoring**: Numbered cards (2-10) = Face value. Face cards (J, Q, K) = 10. Ace = 11. Joker = 15 points (or 25 as penalty).",
    keyRules: [
      'First meld must total 40 or 51 points',
      'Sets: 3-4 cards of same rank (duplicates allowed from different decks)',
